# PDF Password Auditing with John the Ripper

# 1. Extract the PDF hash
pdf2john.py protected.pdf > pdf.hash

# 2. Verify the hash was created
cat pdf.hash

# 3. Start cracking
john pdf.hash

# Optional: Use a wordlist
john --wordlist=/path/to/wordlist.txt pdf.hash

# 4. Show the recovered password
john --show pdf.hash


Example: 
pdf2john.py secret.pdf > secret.hash
cat secret.hash
john --wordlist=rockyou.txt secret.hash
john --show secret.hash




